@startuml DataFlow_Audit_Trail
' Purpose: Data flow diagram showing audit trail collection and querying
' Used in: architecture.adoc - Audit Trail section

title Data Flow: Complete Audit Trail

' --- Participants / grouped boxes ---
box "Event Sources" #LightBlue
  participant "TDLib Adapter\n(Port 9080)" as TDLib
  participant "Intent Classifier\n(Port 9082)" as Intent
  participant "Policy Engine\n(Port 9083)" as Policy
  participant "LLM Orchestrator\n(Port 9084)" as LLM
  participant "Moderation Service\n(Port 9085)" as Moderation
  participant "Conversation Context\n(Port 9081)" as Context
end box

box "Kafka Topics" #LightYellow
  participant "telegram.raw.\nmessages" as RawTopic
  participant "messages.\nclassified" as ClassifiedTopic
  participant "policies.\ndecisions" as DecisionTopic
  participant "responses.\ngenerated" as ResponseTopic
  participant "moderation.\nflags" as ModerationTopic
  participant "audit.events" as AuditTopic #Red
end box

box "Audit Service (Port 9086)" #LightGray
  participant "Audit Event\nConsumer" as AuditConsumer
  participant "Event\nNormalizer" as Normalizer
  participant "Log\nFormatter" as Formatter
  participant "Metrics\nAggregator" as MetricsAgg
  participant "Alert\nEngine" as AlertEngine
  participant "Audit\nAPI" as AuditAPI
end box

box "PostgreSQL" #White
  participant "AuditEvents" as EventTable
  participant "AuditLogs" as LogTable
  participant "CostTracking" as CostTableDB
  participant "Metrics" as MetricsTable
end box

participant "Prometheus" as Prometheus
participant "AlertManager" as AlertMgr
actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Admin API\n(Port 9087)" as AdminAPI

' === EVENT PRODUCTION FLOW ===
' == Event Production to Audit Topic ==

' Each service publishes audit events
TDLib ->> AuditTopic : AuditEvent (MESSAGE_RECEIVED)
Intent ->> AuditTopic : AuditEvent (INTENT_CLASSIFIED)
Policy ->> AuditTopic : AuditEvent (POLICY_EVALUATED)
LLM ->> AuditTopic : AuditEvent (RESPONSE_GENERATED)
Moderation ->> AuditTopic : AuditEvent (MODERATION_APPLIED)
Context ->> AuditTopic : AuditEvent (CONTEXT_UPDATED)

' Main pipeline events also feed audit
RawTopic ->> AuditTopic : Mirror for traceability
ClassifiedTopic ->> AuditTopic : Mirror for traceability
DecisionTopic ->> AuditTopic : Mirror for traceability
ResponseTopic ->> AuditTopic : Mirror for traceability
ModerationTopic ->> AuditTopic : Mirror for traceability

' === AUDIT SERVICE PROCESSING ===
' == Audit Event Processing ==

AuditTopic ->> AuditConsumer : All audit events
' activate AuditConsumer

AuditConsumer ->> Normalizer : Normalize event
' activate Normalizer
Normalizer ->> Normalizer : Validate schema
Normalizer ->> Normalizer : Enrich with metadata
Normalizer ->> AuditConsumer : NormalizedAuditEvent
'
' deactivate Normalizer

AuditConsumer ->> Formatter : Format for storage
' activate Formatter
Formatter ->> Formatter : Structured JSON
Formatter ->> Formatter : Add timestamps
Formatter ->> Formatter : Hash for integrity
Formatter ->> AuditConsumer : FormattedLog
'
' deactivate Formatter

AuditConsumer ->> EventTable : INSERT audit event
AuditConsumer ->> LogTable : INSERT formatted log

' Cost tracking
alt Event contains cost data
    AuditConsumer ->> CostTableDB : Track costs
    CostTableDB ->> AuditConsumer : Aggregated
end

' Metrics aggregation
AuditConsumer ->> MetricsAgg : Send metrics
' activate MetricsAgg
MetricsAgg ->> MetricsAgg : Calculate rates
MetricsAgg ->> MetricsAgg : Compute percentiles
MetricsAgg ->> MetricsTable : Store metrics
MetricsAgg ->> Prometheus : Export metrics

' deactivate MetricsAgg

' Alerting
AuditConsumer ->> AlertEngine : Check thresholds
' activate AlertEngine

alt Threshold exceeded
    AlertEngine ->> AlertEngine : Evaluate severity
    AlertEngine ->> AlertMgr : Send alert
    AlertMgr ->> Admin : Notification
end

' deactivate AlertEngine
'
' deactivate AuditConsumer

' === AUDIT QUERY FLOW ===
== Audit Query and Reporting ==

Admin ->> AdminAPI : Query audit logs
AdminAPI ->> AuditAPI : GET /audit/query

AuditAPI ->> EventTable : Execute query / Filter by time/action/actor
AuditAPI ->> LogTable : Fetch details

EventTable -->> AuditAPI : Query results
AuditAPI ->> AdminAPI : AuditReport
AdminAPI ->> Admin : JSON/CSV report

' Specific query examples
Admin ->> AdminAPI : GET /audit/costs
AdminAPI ->> AuditAPI : Cost query
AuditAPI ->> CostTableDB : Aggregate
CostTableDB -->> AuditAPI : CostReport
AuditAPI ->> AdminAPI : CostSummary
AdminAPI ->> Admin : Costs by service/model

' === AUDIT DATA MODEL (summarized) ===
note right
  AuditEvent (example fields): eventId(UUID), eventType, action, actor, resource,
  outcome, details(map), processingTimeMs, timestamp, correlationId, serviceVersion.

  Actor: type (SYSTEM/USER/SERVICE), id, serviceName, userName, ipAddress.
  Resource: type, id, name, attributes.
  CostRecord: id, correlationId, serviceName, modelType, inputTokens,
  outputTokens, costAmount, currency, timestamp, tenantId.

  IntegrityHash: eventId, previousHash, currentHash, timestamp.

  Note: For full data model details see architecture.adoc / audit schema docs.
end note

' === CORRELATION ID TRACING ===
note right
  Tracing example (correlationId flows):
  1) TDLib Adapter -> telegram.raw.messages
  2) Intent Classifier -> messages.classified (same ID)
  3) Policy Engine -> policies.decisions (same ID)
  4) LLM Orchestrator -> responses.generated (same ID)
  5) Audit Service collects linked events (same ID)

  Query: GET /audit/trace/{correlationId} -> returns complete processing chain
end note

' === COMPLIANCE NOTES ===
note right
  Audit Compliance:
  • Immutability: Audit logs WORM (Write Once Read Many)
  • Integrity: Cryptographic hash chain for tamper detection
  • Retention: 7 years (configurable tiers)
  • Access: Role-based query access (admin, auditor, system)
  • Export: CSV/JSON/PDF formats for regulatory requests
  • Real-time: Stream to SIEM (Splunk, ELK, etc.)
end note

@enduml
